00:27:13.031 --> 00:27:14.599
THEY MAY DO THE WORK TO CORRECT

00:27:14.666 --> 00:27:15.700
THE DEFICIENCY, ONLY TO FIND

00:27:15.767 --> 00:27:17.702
THAT THEY WERE TOO LATE. AB 3184

00:27:17.769 --> 00:27:20.372
WOULD SPECIFY THAT COUNTIES

00:27:20.438 --> 00:27:21.373
CANNOT CERTIFY THE ELECTION

00:27:21.439 --> 00:27:23.308
RESULTS UNTIL THE 28TH DAY AFTER

00:27:23.375 --> 00:27:25.443
THE ELECTION, AND THAT VOTERS

00:27:25.510 --> 00:27:27.445
AND CAMPAIGNS HAVE UNTIL THE

00:27:27.512 --> 00:27:28.613
26TH DAY TO FIX SIGNATURE

00:27:28.680 --> 00:27:31.082
ISSUES. THIS MAXIMIZES THE TIME

00:27:31.149 --> 00:27:33.985
TO CORRECT A SIGNATURE ISSUE AND

00:27:34.052 --> 00:27:35.020
ENSURES THAT THE VOTE IS

00:27:35.086 --> 00:27:36.855
COUNTED. IT ALSO PROVIDES A DATE

00:27:36.921 --> 00:27:37.922
CERTAIN SO THAT EVERYONE IS

00:27:37.989 --> 00:27:39.758
OPERATING UNDER THE SAME RULES.

00:27:39.824 --> 00:27:40.925
THE BILL RETAINS ITS PREVIOUS

00:27:40.992 --> 00:27:42.594
